@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
actor User
participant UI
participant Logic
participant Model
participant Storage
User -> UI : delete 1
UI -> Logic : execute("delete 1")
Logic -> Model : snapshot and resolve displayed target
Logic --> UI : preview and y/n prompt (no save)
UI --> User : show preview
User -> UI : y
UI -> Logic : execute("y")
Logic -> Model : delete resolved contact; show full list
Logic -> Storage : saveContactFile(changed data)
Storage -> Storage : write sibling temp; validate; atomic replace
Storage --> Logic : saved
Logic --> UI : deleted details and remaining count
UI --> User : show result
note over Logic, Model : On save failure, restore data and original filter.
@enduml
